This is an ADDENDUM to the LEGAL notice for this Plus version of ChipMachine.

Everything in the LEGAL notice applies unchanged. This file adds the components
that are compiled into the Plus build ONLY, and repeats nothing from LEGAL.

Every component below is copyleft (GPL-2 / GPL-3 / LGPL-3) or otherwise carries
terms that prevent redistribution through the Mac App Store, which is why each
is built into this variant alone (CM_VARIANT=plus). Their runtime payloads --
data/uade, data/c64 and data/sc68 -- ship only with this variant as well.

